message: >-
  Please cite the version-specific archive DOI for the software used.
  Cite the companion interim report separately for its mathematical statements.
type: software
title: "Towards a computer-assisted exclusion of Rupert's property for the parabigyrate rhombicosidodecahedron: interim verification package"
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Yoo"
    given-names: "Sumin"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, Republic of Korea"
license: MIT
# The code is MIT licensed. Paper text and data are CC-BY-4.0;
