abstract: >-
  An interim verification package for local exclusion theorems concerning
  Johnson solid J73. It contains an independent checker, frozen production
  status data, tube regions and the certificates specified in the README.
  The global computation and exhaustive verification remain unfinished.
keywords:
  - Rupert problem
  - Johnson solid J73
  - parabigyrate rhombicosidodecahedron
  - exact arithmetic
  - interval arithmetic
  - computer-assisted proof
date-released: "2026-10-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ysmin1575/j73-rupert"
url: "https://github.com/ysmin1575/j73-rupert"
